---
/**
 * Full-bleed black stage for a run of case-study content, matching the
 * Outcomes panel's look (bg-void, text-bone, data-dark-stage for the Nav
 * inversion) but usable mid-article rather than only as the page-level
 * MetricPanel. Breaks out of the 1000px prose column to the viewport edges
 * since it is nested inside .prose-case, unlike MetricPanel which is a
 * sibling of <article>.
 *
 * .prose-case forces `p` and `strong` to ink via [&_p]/[&_strong] selectors
 * of equal specificity, so those need an !important override here to read on
 * a dark background. `h3` has no forced colour in .prose-case, so it inherits
 * text-bone without any extra work.
 */
---

<div
  data-dark-stage
  class="relative left-1/2 right-1/2 w-screen -mx-[50vw] bg-void px-6 py-24 text-bone md:px-14 md:py-32"
>
  <div class="dark-stage mx-auto max-w-[1000px]">
    <slot />
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .dark-stage :global(p) {
    color: var(--color-bone) !important;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .dark-stage :global(strong) {
    color: var(--color-bone) !important;
  }
</style>
